  - speaker: Pip
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f3c5a07a818135f469b115ad655a7cd8, type: 3}
    text: It is so dark down here... but look! Something is glowing, way over there!
  - speaker: You
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 24d008a2918cc544f87755498eae8b2b, type: 3}
    text: That must be the Golden Clam.
  - speaker: Pip
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f3c5a07a818135f469b115ad655a7cd8, type: 3}
    text: Marlo said three pearls wake each ruin. Let us find them together!
